  "description": "High-performance functional Result types for .NET with explicit error handling. Features: Railway Oriented Programming, exhaustive pattern matching, Result with multiple specific error types (Result<TSuccess, TError1, TError2, ...>), source-generated semantic Match extensions, and TryGetError<T> for type-based error handling. No exceptions, zero allocations.",
